"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FSuperNerdTheresAPokemonLabText|2": "there's a lab",
"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FSuperNerdTheresAPokemonLabText|3": "for KITH.",
"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FSuperNerdTheresAPokemonLabText|4": "They can bring",
"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FSuperNerdTheresAPokemonLabText|5": "fossils back to",
