"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FRocket3BattleText|0": "Big heist in",
"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FRocket3BattleText|1": "progress! Beat it,",
"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FRocket3BattleText|2": "shorty!",
"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FRocket3EndBattleText|0": "Huh. You're",
"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FRocket3EndBattleText|1": "no pushover.",
"text/MtMoonB2F.asm|_MtMoonB2FRocket3AfterBattleText|0": "Find a fossil?",
